---
// src/components/home/WhyWeExistSection.astro
// Section 03: Why We Exist — Data Urgensi Sosial & Rantai Transformasi Nilai
---

<section class="why-exist-section" id="why-we-exist">
  <div class="why-exist-container">
    <div class="why-exist-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Problem Narrative & Ecosystem Thesis -->
      <div class="why-exist-left reveal-on-scroll">
        <span class="editorial-kicker">Kenapa Global Village Fund?</span>

        <h2 class="why-exist-title">
          Kebaikan yang Tumbuh Menjadi Ekosistem.
        </h2>

        <p class="why-exist-lead">
          Kebaikan tidak berhenti pada satu bantuan. Ia dapat tumbuh menjadi pendidikan, kompetensi, kemandirian, dan kebermanfaatan yang dirasakan lebih luas.
        </p>

        <p class="why-exist-sub">
          Global Village Fund hadir sebagai wadah kebaikan dan kolaborasi untuk mendukung penguatan ekosistem pesantren—menghubungkan pendidikan, pengembangan kompetensi, lingkungan, kemandirian, dan kebermanfaatan sosial.
        </p>

        <!-- 3 Transformation Value Pillars -->
        <div class="transformation-pillars">
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <span class="pillar-num">01</span>
            <div class="pillar-body">
              <h4 class="pillar-heading">Dukungan Holistik yang Membangun Kemampuan</h4>
              <p class="pillar-desc">
                Kami percaya dukungan yang tepat membangun daya mandiri santri, bukan sekadar memenuhi kebutuhan konsumtif sesaat.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillar-item">
            <span class="pillar-num">02</span>
            <div class="pillar-body">
              <h4 class="pillar-heading">Integrasi Ibadah, Vokasi, & Lingkungan</h4>
              <p class="pillar-desc">
                Masjid Khairu Ummah Sugro, SMK Skill Village, dan kawasan Agro-Technopark terhubung dalam satu kawasan terpadu.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillar-item">
            <span class="pillar-num">03</span>
            <div class="pillar-body">
              <h4 class="pillar-heading">Kebermanfaatan yang Berkelanjutan</h4>
              <p class="pillar-desc">
                Mencetak generasi muzakki baru yang mandiri secara ekonomi dan mampu memberi dampak nyata bagi masyarakat luas.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Visual Metrics of the Ecosystem (Clean Metric Board) -->
      <div class="why-exist-right reveal-on-scroll delay-200">
        <div class="evidence-board">
          <div class="evidence-header">
            <span class="evidence-title">Fondasi Kawasan & Ekosistem</span>
            <span class="evidence-note">Pilot Project Jonggol</span>
          </div>

          <!-- 4 Core Metrics Grid -->
          <div class="metrics-grid">
            <div class="metric-card">
              <span class="metric-num">1</span>
              <h4 class="metric-label">Pilot Project</h4>
              <p class="metric-desc">
                Pesantren Integratif Holistik Skill Village Islamic School di Jonggol Bogor.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="metric-card">
              <span class="metric-num">±3 Ha</span>
              <h4 class="metric-label">Kawasan Pengembangan</h4>
              <p class="metric-desc">
                Lahan terpadu masjid, ruang vokasi, greenhouse, dan agriteknologi ramah lingkungan.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="metric-card">
              <span class="metric-num">FAST</span>
              <h4 class="metric-label">Character Development</h4>
              <p class="metric-desc">
                Pembentukan karakter luhur Fathonah, Amanah, Shiddiq, dan Tabligh.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="metric-card">
              <span class="metric-num">∞</span>
              <h4 class="metric-label">Potensi Kebermanfaatan</h4>
              <p class="metric-desc">
                Pahala jariyah abadi dan dampak kemandirian yang terus berlipat ganda.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Narrative Divider -->
          <div class="evidence-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <!-- Philosophical Principle Quote -->
          <div class="evidence-quote">
            <blockquote class="quote-text">
              “Kebaikan tidak berhenti pada satu bantuan. Ia dapat tumbuh menjadi pendidikan, kompetensi, kemandirian, dan kebermanfaatan yang dirasakan lebih luas.”
            </blockquote>
            <div class="quote-source">
              <span class="source-author">Global Village Fund (GVF)</span>
              <span class="source-detail">Inisiatif Yayasan Permata Cendekia Indonesia</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why-exist-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 104px 0 112px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gvf-surface-200, #e2e8f0);
  }

  /* typeui principle: 1280px standard container */
  .why-exist-container {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
  }

  .why-exist-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* Editorial Kicker (Quiet, confident, no AI capsule pills or dots) */
  .editorial-kicker {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gvf-blue-vibrant, #0969da);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  /* Display Title (typeui principle: line-height tight, 32px margin bottom) */
  .why-exist-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 3.8vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--gvf-navy-dark, #061829);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  /* Body narrative with optimal reading measure */
  .why-exist-lead {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: var(--gvf-text-body, #334155);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .why-exist-sub {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: var(--gvf-text-muted, #64748b);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  /* 3 Transformation Value Pillars */
  .transformation-pillars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gvf-surface-200, #e2e8f0);
  }

  .pillar-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .pillar-num {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--gvf-blue-vibrant, #0969da);
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    min-width: 28px;
  }

  .pillar-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .pillar-heading {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gvf-navy-primary, #0a2540);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .pillar-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem; /* 14px floor */
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #64748b;
    max-width: 54ch;
  }

  /* Right Column: Unified Evidence Board */
  .why-exist-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .evidence-board {
    background: var(--gvf-surface-50, #f8fafc);
    border: 1px solid var(--gvf-surface-200, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
  }

  .evidence-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9);
  }

  .evidence-title {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gvf-navy-primary, #0a2540);
  }

  .evidence-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  /* Dual Metrics */
  .metrics-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .metric-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .metric-num {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--gvf-navy-dark, #061829);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .metric-label {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gvf-navy-primary, #0a2540);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .metric-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem; /* 14px floor */
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  /* Divider */
  .evidence-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--gvf-surface-200, #e2e8f0);
    margin: 32px 0 28px;
  }

  /* Philosophical Quote (Dignified editorial attribution) */
  .evidence-quote {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .quote-text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #1e293b;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .quote-source {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .source-author {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gvf-navy-primary, #0a2540);
  }

  .source-detail {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .why-exist-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .why-exist-lead,
    .why-exist-sub,
    .pillar-desc {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .why-exist-section {
      padding: 72px 0 80px;
    }

    .why-exist-container {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .evidence-board {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
